---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Maik Pleines - Software Developer">
	<main>
		<section id="about" class="section">
			<h1>Hi! I'm Maik, and I like to make Software!</h1>
			<p>I'm a experienced software developer who likes to build stuff. I love creating things that live on <span class="funky">t</span><span class="funky">h</span><span class="funky">e</span> <span class="funky">w</span><span class="funky">e</span><span class="funky">b</span>.</p>
		<section>
		<section id="projects" class="section">
			<h1>What I am working on</h1>
			<p>Right now, I'm developing <a href="https://resugenie.app">resugenie.</a> - an AI-powered resume builder designed to help job seekers craft standout resumes effortlessly.</p>
			<p>I have build several other projects which you can find on my <a href="https://github.com/mpleines/">Github profile</a>.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="contact" class="section">
			<h1>Contact</h1>
			<p>If you want to know more you can <a href="/resume">download my resume</a> or just shoot me an email at: <a href="mailto:service.mpleines@gmail.com">service.mpleines@gmail.com</a> - I'd love to hear from you.</p>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.section {
		margin-top: 64px;
	}

	.funky {
		font-weight: bold;
		display: inline-block;
		transform: rotate(4deg) translateX(0) translateY(0);
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
	}
</style>
